@startuml
title EcoBrief Bolivia - De ruido digital a brief util

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAF7
  BorderColor #2F6B4F
}

rectangle "Fuentes locales\n(medios bolivianos)" as A
rectangle "Noticias repetidas\ny dispersas" as B
rectangle "EcoBrief\nlimpia + deduplica + prioriza" as C
rectangle "IA responsable\nsolo sobre candidatos utiles" as D
rectangle "Briefs personalizados\ncon impacto medible" as E

A --> B
B --> C
C --> D
D --> E

note bottom of C
Reduce ruido antes de usar IA
end note

@enduml
